== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[fimm]]'' "[[five]]". Meaning '''twenty and five'''.
=== Cardinal number ===

'''tuttugu og átta'''

# [[twenty-eight]], cardinal number after [[tuttugu og sjö]] and before [[tuttugu og níu]]

